---
description: Keep forms dense with paired short fields, narrow dropdowns, and inline hints
alwaysApply: true
---

# Form density

When laying out forms:

- Pair short fields two per row (`sm:grid-cols-2` or a wrapping flex line). Leave descriptions, URL lists, tag pickers, and textareas full width.
- Size enum dropdowns to their options (about `w-40`, with `w-fit` on the wrapper). Do not stretch a short select with `w-full`.
- Put a field label on the same line as a compact date or time control.
- Put a short hint on that same line, after the control, in italic muted type (`text-[11px] italic text-slate-500`). Do not give the hint its own row.
